Standards-Version: 0.6.0
Version: 0.1.0-1
Licence: Free
Description: SSH server for RISC OS 5
 An SSH server built on libssh and mbedTLS, running as a desktop task.
 Accepts public-key logins only; runs *commands and interactive sessions
 in a TaskWindow, and serves sftp/scp.  Authorized keys are managed in a
 window, with an import from another machine.  Configuration lives in
 Choices:SSHd.  SSHd itself is MIT licensed; it statically links libssh
 (LGPL 2.1), mbedTLS (Apache 2.0) and UnixLib, see RiscPkg.Copyright.
Homepage: https://github.com/cr/riscosshd
Depends: CryptRandom
Components: Apps.Network.!SSHd (Movable LookAt Run)
